        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Benito Juárez</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">1806 CE – 1872 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">21 March 1806 in the village of San Pablo Guelatao, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oaxaca">Oaxaca</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/viceroyalty-of-new-spain">New Spain</a>, to Zapotec peasants, Brígida García and Marcelino Juárez</span></div>
